      <h1>Jewellery Brand E-commerce Website in Bengaluru 2026 &mdash; Complete FAQ</h1>
      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on e-commerce website + shopify development for jewellery + fine jewellery brands in Bengaluru, India &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (CDSCO + BIS + Karnataka FDA), channels, timelines, and how ITD GrowthLabs approaches this work.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-intro">
      <p>A jewellery e-commerce website in Bengaluru, India is trust + certification + AR-driven. Bengaluru is India's VC-backed D2C startup + tech + design hub. Home to Foxtale, Minimalist, Aukera, Deconstruct, Just Herbs + hundreds of D2C startups. LTV/CAC-driven, Shopify + headless architecture, tech-native founders. Jewellery Shopify needs BIS HUID display, GIA/IGI/HRD certification per SKU, 360-spin + macro photography, AR try-on (ring + earring + necklace), gold-rate live pricing (India), WhatsApp concierge for AOV > Rs 25,000, home-trial + buyback programme. This FAQ answers 12 questions Bengaluru jewellery founders ask most.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD JEWELLERY + D2C PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong>
      This FAQ is grounded in live category work. ITD's jewellery D2C 50-piece cluster + <a href='/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>Fabelia D2C case study</a> + <a href='/resources/fine_jewelry_vs_fashion_jewelry_d2c.php' style='color:#4338ca;font-weight:700;'>fine vs fashion jewellery positioning</a> ground this playbook. Every answer below is written from real client engagements and published playbooks, not templated content.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much does a jewellery Shopify build cost in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique Rs 4-7 lakh (5-7 weeks) — theme + core apps + 50-150 SKUs + BIS HUID display + basic AR + video PDP. Mid-market Rs 7-14 lakh (8-12 weeks) — premium theme + full AR + certification display + WhatsApp concierge + gold-rate live pricing + subscription. Enterprise Rs 14-25 lakh (12-18 weeks) — custom theme + advanced AR + multi-region + home-trial + buyback programme + tokenised gold. Post-launch Rs 50K-2.5 lakh/month. Jewellery has higher build cost due to certification + AR + gold-rate integration complexity.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How long does a jewellery Shopify build take in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique 5-7 weeks. Mid-market 8-12 weeks. Enterprise 12-18 weeks. Timeline gates: theme + certification display (3-4 weeks), high-res + macro + 360-spin photography integration (2-4 weeks), AR try-on integration (2-3 weeks), BIS HUID + GIA/IGI certification display + verification (1-2 weeks), gold-rate live pricing + WhatsApp concierge (2-3 weeks), home-trial + buyback programme setup (2-4 weeks). In Bengaluru timing to complete 10-14 weeks pre-Ugadi + Diwali + wedding season + Karnataka Rajyotsava + Christmas + New Year urban peak captures wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What Shopify apps do jewellery brands need?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) AR try-on: Vue.ai ($300-1000/mo, India-strong) OR Perfect Corp YouCam ($200-800/mo) OR 3DLOOK (enterprise) for ring + earring + necklace. (2) Certification + trust display: custom PDP blocks or Trustpilot/Yotpo. (3) High-res + macro + 360-spin: custom via Cloudinary/Shopify Files. (4) Gold-rate live pricing: custom via MetalsAPI or gold-rate API integration. (5) WhatsApp concierge: Interakt/AiSensy + custom high-AOV flow. (6) Wishlist + notify-me: Klaviyo. (7) Reviews with authenticated purchase: Judge.me/Loox/Yotpo. (8) Home-trial + buyback: custom app or manual workflow. (9) Insurance: custom or 3rd-party. Total tooling Rs 30-100K/month.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we build jewellery on Shopify, Magento, or custom?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Shopify Standard for Rs 15 lakh-2 crore/month. Shopify Plus for Rs 2-30 crore/month + wholesale/B2B + subscription. Headless for Rs 5+ crore/month + custom-heavy (advanced AR + tokenised gold). Magento rarely optimal — heavier + slower + more expensive. Custom for very specific needs (regional gold-rate + certification + auth flow). For Bengaluru jewellery brands, Shopify Standard right year 1-2, upgrade to Plus at Rs 2-3 crore/month.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What conversion rate is realistic for jewellery Shopify in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Well-executed jewellery Shopify: 0.8-2.5% overall (lower than fashion/skincare due to higher AOV + longer consideration). First-time: 0.3-1%. Returning: 3-8%. Subscription: 8-15%. Key levers: 360-spin + macro photography (20-40% lift), AR try-on (15-30% lift for ring/earring/necklace), certification display (10-20% lift), video PDP (15-30% lift), WhatsApp concierge for AOV > Rs 25,000 (30-50% lift), home-trial programme (25-50% conversion lift). Below-Rs 25,000 AOV converts 2-4%; Rs 25,000-1L AOV converts 0.8-2%; Rs 1L+ AOV converts 0.3-1% without concierge, 1-3% with concierge + home-trial.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does multi-currency + multi-region setup work for jewellery in India?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Shopify Markets + regional payment + gold-rate + certification per region. India: Razorpay/Cashfree + EMI + BNPL. GCC: Tap/Stripe/Tabby. Gold-rate live pricing varies by country (India-BIS + Dubai-DMCC + Saudi-Namshi rate feeds). Cross-border duty + jewellery-specific customs handling. Adds 3-5 weeks + Rs 2-4 lakh to base build. For Bengaluru jewellery brands targeting India + GCC + NRI diaspora simultaneously, multi-region + gold-rate essential from launch.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What post-launch Shopify retainer for jewellery in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Ongoing feature dev + collection landing pages Rs 30-100K/month. App + theme updates Rs 25-60K/quarter. CRO + A/B testing Rs 40K-2 lakh/month. Analytics audit Rs 30-80K/quarter. Total Rs 50K-3 lakh/month. Jewellery needs seasonal collection pages (bridal + festive + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras) — adds Rs 40K-1 lakh/quarter.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Do jewellery brands need mobile app + native app?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Not year 1-2. Justified at Rs 3-5 crore/month + strong subscription + community. Native app benefits: push notifications for restock + drop, better AR try-on UX, exclusive drops + community, offline browsing for luxury bridal. Cost Rs 12-35 lakh initial + Rs 50K-2 lakh/month. For Bengaluru jewellery brands, WhatsApp concierge + Instagram broadcast + Klaviyo email substitute effectively until scale justifies.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do jewellery brands handle returns + exchanges in Bengaluru?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Jewellery returns 5-15% (lowest D2C category). Returns portal + strict authentication (BIS HUID + GIA/IGI verification on return). Made-to-order + engraved + customised — no returns policy (clearly communicated pre-purchase). Standard pieces — 15-30 day return window with hallmarking + certification intact + no wear/scratches. Buyback programme (lifetime for gold at prevailing market rate less making-charge deduction) — differentiator + trust-builder. Insurance-backed shipping for high-AOV. Reverse logistics: insured + tracked + signature-required. In Bengaluru, CDSCO + BIS + Karnataka FDA defines statutory minimums.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What integrations are essential for jewellery Shopify?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Payment: Razorpay/Cashfree + Tap + Stripe + EMI + BNPL. (2) Shipping: insured + tracked (Sequel Logistics + Malca-Amit + Brinks for high-AOV). (3) CRM/email: Klaviyo. (4) WhatsApp concierge: Interakt/AiSensy custom high-AOV flow. (5) Reviews: Judge.me/Yotpo with authenticated purchase. (6) Analytics: GA4 + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + Merchant Center. (7) AR try-on: Vue.ai/Perfect Corp. (8) Gold-rate + certification: custom via MetalsAPI + BIS/GIA integration. (9) Home-trial + buyback: custom workflow. (10) Insurance: 3rd-party integration. Total integration 3-5 weeks in mid-market/enterprise build.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">When should jewellery brands upgrade to Shopify Plus?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">At Rs 2-3 crore/month + one of: (a) wholesale/B2B, (b) subscription programme scale (jewellery subscription growing category), (c) multi-region multi-currency multi-gold-rate, (d) high-AOV private-viewing appointments, (e) Launchpad + Scripts for advanced pricing/discounting. Cost: $2K USD/month + Rs 4-10 lakh migration. For Bengaluru jewellery brands, Plus justified once sustained Rs 3 crore/month + multi-region needs.</div>
      </div>
