        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Free 30-min discovery + tier recommendation. Full-stack: theme + AR (Vue.ai) + certification display + 360-spin/macro photography integration + WhatsApp concierge + gold-rate live pricing + home-trial + buyback + multi-region. Timeline 5-18 weeks. Post-launch bundles Shopify + marketing retainer. Grounded in ITD's 50-piece jewellery cluster + <a href='/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php'>Fabelia case study</a>. See <a href='/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php'>Digital Marketing for Jewellery Brands</a>. Retainer starts at Rs 85,000-4.2 lakh.</div>
